==Event Information==
The Battle Cats has soared to a cool 86 MILLION downloads worldwide, and it's time to celebrate!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between November 20th (11:00am) and December 4th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Celebration Login Stamps!'''}}<br>
Get awesome rewards from daily Login Stamps!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between November 20th, 2023 (11:00am) and January 15th, 2024 (10:59am)!'''}}

Earn one stamp each day when you visit the Cat Base menu in The Battle Cats! You can earn a {{Color|#00CCFF|'''total of 9 Rare Tickets if you log in every single day during the event!'''}}<br>
Also, limited Special unit {{Color|#FF0000|'''Gold Brick Cat'''}} can also be obtained during the 30-day login period.

※Up to 30 Stamps can be earned during this event.<br>
※Activate Gold Brick Cat by visiting the Special Cats section of the Upgrade menu.<br>
※Gold Brick Cat cannot be earned again if it was claimed during the previous event.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''・Monthly Event All-Stars Grateful Gathering'''}}<br>
A super challenge featuring the familiar faces of enemies from Monthly Event stages, gathered together for one tough map! Get a chance to earn up to 30,000,000 XP by clearing the stage!

Topple these seasonal baddies and earn mountains of XP to power up your Cat Army!

※ After clearing a stage in a Gauntlet map, there will be a cooldown period before you are able to challenge the next stage in the series.<br>
※ Spending a Catamin A during this cooldown period will allow you to immediately challenge the next Gauntlet stage without waiting.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Fight back against dark forces in "Cover of Darkness"!'''}}<br>
It's a springtime period piece! A flood of Black enemies attacks your cats in this special Cover of Darkness map!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between November 20th (11:00am) and December 4th (10:59am)!'''}}

※ After clearing a stage, the next stage can be attempted after some time has passed.<br>
※ Spend a Catamin A during the cooldown period to skip the waiting time and challenge the stage immediately.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Treasure Festivals Everyday!'''}}<br>
During this event, get increased Treasure Drop Rates in Story Mode chapters for a special Treasure Festival, all day every day!<br>
On {{Color|#34A853|'''even days'''}} visit {{Color|#34A853|'''Empire of Cats'''}}, and on {{Color|#00CCFF|'''odd days'''}} head to {{Color|#00CCFF|'''Into the Future'''}} to take advantage of this special event!<br>
Plus, don't miss the Treasure Festival for {{Color|#0000FF|'''Cats of the Cosmos'''}} on {{Color|#0000FF|'''11/22, 11/25, 11/28, 12/1, 12/4!'''}}

※Please note: Treasure Festivals for Empire of Cats and Into the Future will appear only once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared. The Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos will appear once Into the Future Ch. 1 has been cleared.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Half-Off Energy Cost for Empire, Future and Cosmos stages!'''}}<br>
During this event, the Cat Energy cost to challenge stages in the Empire of Cats, Into the Future, or Cats of the Cosmos will be half the normal cost each day during the times below!<br>
7:00am ~ 8:59am / 12:00pm ~ 1:59pm / 7:00pm ~ 8:59pm

※ This Cat Energy cost reduction does not apply to Zombie Outbreak stages.<br>
※ If the Cat Energy reduction does not appear at the listed times above, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version available.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Limited GAMATOTO Expedition Areas'''}}<br>
Only during this event, you can send your Gamatoto adventurer to the limited areas {{Color|#46BDC6|'''Cats Eye Cave'''}} and {{Color|#46BDC6|'''XP Harvest'''}} for a special set of Cats Eye rewards!<br>
Get as many Cats Eyes as you can and help your units break through to even higher levels!<br>
Don't miss this special chance!

{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・XP Harvest (3 areas)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between November 20th (11:00am) and November 27th (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Cats Eye Cave'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between November 27th (11:00am) and December 4th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Catfruit / Catseye Limited Item Capsule Events!'''}}<br>
At the Capsule Menu, tap the buttons at top left to switch between standard Capsule events and the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catseye Limited Capsules'''}} & {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catfruit Limited Capsules'''}}!<br>
Power up your Cats! Don't miss out on these cool items!

・Catseye Item Capsules<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between November 20th (11:00am) and November 27th (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
・Catfruit Item Capsules<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between November 27th (11:00am) and December 4th (10:59am)!'''}}

※The Catfruit Limited Capsules provide Catfruit and XP rewards, while Catseye Limited Capsules will provide Catseyes and XP!<br>
※Catfruit Limited Capsules will appear after Empire of Cats Ch. 3 is completed in The Battle Cats, and Catseye Limited Capsules will appear in the Cat Capsules once User Rank 1600 is cleared.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Cat Food presents every day!'''}}<br>
Visit the Battle Cats app to collect a reward of {{Color|#FF00FF|'''20 Cat Food'''}} each day of the campaign! Check in and profit!

